IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-COUNT PIC 99 VALUE 3.
01 WS-TABLE.
   05 WS-ENTRY OCCURS 1 TO 6 TIMES DEPENDING ON WS-COUNT.
      10 WS-VAL PIC 9(2).
01 WS-I PIC 99 VALUE 1.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    MOVE 11 TO WS-VAL(1).
    MOVE 22 TO WS-VAL(2).
    MOVE 33 TO WS-VAL(3).
    MOVE 11 TO WS-VAL(WS-I).
